From: Mario Geiger <geiger.mario@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pigeon: mark the version 10.20261006-pigeon1

Not for upstream. Build/Version.hs takes the version from the first line of
CHANGELOG, so this entry makes `git annex version` say which build runs.
---
 CHANGELOG | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

--- a/CHANGELOG
+++ b/CHANGELOG
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+git-annex (10.20261006-pigeon1) pigeon; urgency=medium
+
+  * pigeon's build of 10.20261006, from third_party/git-annex in
+    https://github.com/mariogeiger/pigeon, with two fixes to the P2P
+    protocol server:
+  * CHECKPRESENT no longer reports content that is locked for removal,
+    so two concurrent drops over P2P cannot both count the other's copy.
+  * CONNECTDONE is sent once, after all of a relayed git service's output,
+    so a git fetch over P2P no longer hangs waiting for the end of a pack.
+
+ -- Mario Geiger <geiger.mario@gmail.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0200
+
 git-annex (10.20261006) upstream; urgency=medium
 
   * Fix stack build.
